From: Filippo Falezza <filippo.falezza@outlook.it>
Date: Wed, 7 Oct 2026 20:13:48 +0100
Subject: [PATCH 073/112] arm64: dts: qcom: sm7250-motorola-nairo: Add PON
 reboot modes

Describe the bootloader and recovery restart reasons (the standard
Qualcomm values) so that qcom-pon writes them to the PMIC, plus
Motorola's extra bootloader flag. "reboot bootloader" now reaches
fastboot without the buttons.

This patch was generated by an AI coding assistant (Claude Opus 5.5 in
Claude Code) during an interactive bring-up session on a Motorola Moto G
5G Plus (XT2075-3, "nairo"). It has not yet been reviewed line by line
by a human and needs that review before any submission.

Assisted-by: LLM dtschema
---
 arch/arm64/boot/dts/qcom/sm7250-motorola-nairo.dts | 7 +++++++
 1 file changed, 7 insertions(+)

diff --git a/arch/arm64/boot/dts/qcom/sm7250-motorola-nairo.dts b/arch/arm64/boot/dts/qcom/sm7250-motorola-nairo.dts
index 51a87cb56..4ae9c0843 100644
--- a/arch/arm64/boot/dts/qcom/sm7250-motorola-nairo.dts
+++ b/arch/arm64/boot/dts/qcom/sm7250-motorola-nairo.dts
@@ -441,6 +441,13 @@ &pm8150l_wled {
 	status = "okay";
 };
 
+&pon {
+	mode-bootloader = <0x2>;
+	mode-recovery = <0x1>;
+	/* Motorola's bootloader also wants its "reboot_bl" flag in DVDD_RB_SPARE */
+	motorola,bootloader-spare-flag = <0x4>;
+};
+
 &pon_pwrkey {
 	status = "okay";
 };
